From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: defcom5-rockchip <286489597+defcom5-rockchip@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 12:23:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/rockchip: vop2: reject AFBC modifier (no-flicker
 4K@120 variant)

VOP2 can't decompress AFBC scanout fast enough at 4K@120Hz -> windowed
flicker. First attempt (disable-afbc-win DT prop) REMOVED the AFBC Cluster
planes, killing the primary plane -> no display (black after boot logo).

Instead, reject AFBC modifiers in rockchip_vop2_mod_supported() so the
Cluster plane still registers but only advertises LINEAR -> compositor
composites linear -> linear scanout -> no flicker, display intact.
Confirmed on hardware 2026-06-25.

(cherry picked from commit 472a90918a76d5d3cf8717ef46e53e0f9cf0576a)

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
index a19633c697cc..36e3f6b853ae 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
@@ -3130,6 +3130,18 @@ static bool rockchip_vop2_mod_supported(struct drm_plane *plane, u32 format, u64
 	if (modifier == DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR)
 		return true;
 
+	/*
+	 * Pi Studio NO-FLICKER variant: reject AFBC modifiers so the compositor
+	 * composites to a LINEAR buffer on the (still-registered) Cluster primary.
+	 * The RK3588 VOP2 cannot decompress AFBC scanout fast enough at 4K@120Hz,
+	 * causing windowed/composited flicker (fullscreen linear direct-scanout is
+	 * fine). Unlike disable-afbc-win, which removes the AFBC Cluster planes and
+	 * thus kills the primary plane (no display), this keeps the plane and only
+	 * drops AFBC -> linear scanout -> no flicker. Confirmed on HW 2026-06-25.
+	 */
+	if (rockchip_afbc(plane, modifier))
+		return false;
+
 	if (!rockchip_afbc(plane, modifier) &&
 	    !rockchip_rfbc(plane, modifier) &&
 	    !rockchip_tiled(plane, modifier)) {
